.PP
.nf
Initial setup\&.  If any of `reader`, `parser`, or `writer` are not
specified, ``set_components()`` or the corresponding ``set_\&.\&.\&.()``
method should be called with component names
(`set_reader` sets the parser as well)\&.

.fi
.PP
 
